+## S306p REVIEW 89'S FOUR FINDINGS IN THE QUEUE'S CODE (the framework's thin path; P-885; B2019; main's M74) (2026-11-27)
+
+- **`scripts/queue/rerun.py`:** a card's Python runs as `python -s`, no longer `-E`, which ignored the PYTHONHASHSEED the
