+- **`tests/test_known_failures.py`:** an entry swapped for another along the list's history, its length kept, fails the
+  gate; a guard that compared lengths fails the test.
+- **`scripts/queue/baseline.py`:** its docstring said the list shipped empty; it ships main's seven first entries.
